hits.text:
How big can Tesla's Robotaxi fleet get by year end? 

@nextbigfuture now tracks growth at 20% week over week, up from his earlier 15% and 17% estimates. If that holds, cumulative miles go from 3.3 million to about 15 million, and that takes roughly 8x the vehicles.

His gut says https://t.co/oafLlbeCsh

